      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "Cancer is a complex, multilevel phenomenon... Standard bench and clinical research approaches alone are not well suited to account for this complexity... To overcome persistent barriers to providing high-quality, equitable care, approaches are needed to address this complexity and provide guidance for successful intervention.",
      "reason": "The text explains the importance and need for the review by highlighting the complexity of cancer and the limitations of standard approaches, necessitating the use of system dynamics approaches."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
