      "reason": "The text mentions 'past reviews in this field' and explains the need for the current review by stating the specific gap that has not been studied (application to cancer prevention and control)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The review is a systematic review of system dynamics modeling methods and applications, not a review of intervention effects. Therefore, describing the mechanism of action of an intervention is not applicable to the rationale of this methods review."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e5",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The review focuses on modeling methods rather than complex interventions or delivery contexts themselves. Thus, considering a logic model to show relationships between intervention components and outcomes is not applicable to the rationale of this methods review."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 90
